EmitLoopModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Emission of the Loop header plus lowering of the loop body into new blocks (via EmitChild); stamps term["loop"]=1 on the header Branch terminator — the single source of "this is a loop" knowledge for IsLoopHeader (flag-first).
    Provides: EmitLoop(node, blocks, openIdx, counter) -> res.
    DependsOn: EmitChild, NewOpen, FindChild, EmitSeq (via merged namespace)
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../EmitLoop/EmitLoop.sir).
